[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Is That All?]
[00:00.82]Lesson 59 | 第59课
[00:02.90]Is that all? | 就这些吗？
[00:05.48]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.24]Does the lady buy any chalk? | 这位女士买粉笔了吗？
[00:15.41]I want some envelopes, please. | 我要一些信封。
[00:19.86]Do you want the large size or the small size? | 您要大的还是小的？
[00:24.69]The large size, please. | 请给我大的。
[00:27.80]Do you have any writing paper? | 您有信纸吗？
[00:31.48]Yes, we do. | 有，我们有。
[00:33.95]I don't have any small pads. | 我没有小本的。
[00:37.98]I only have large ones. | 我只有大本的。
[00:41.24]Do you want a pad? | 您要一本吗？
[00:43.94]Yes, please. | 是的，谢谢。
[00:46.20]And I want some glue. | 我还要一些胶水。
[00:49.50]A bottle of glue. | 一瓶胶水。
[00:52.33]And I want a large box of chalk, too. | 我还要一大盒粉笔。
[00:58.00]I only have small boxes. | 我只有小盒的。
[01:01.43]Do you want one? | 您要一盒吗？
[01:02.68]No, thank you. | 不，谢谢。
[01:04.76]Is that all? | 就这些吗？
[01:06.37]That's all, thank you. | 就这些，谢谢。
[01:09.14]What else do you want? | 您还想要什么？
[01:11.34]I want my change. | 我要我的零钱。